---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Cases, cartons and payments. Accounted for." description="For distributors who need clear units and a traceable order-to-dispatch workflow.">
<PageHero eyebrow="The Kora product plan" title="Cases, cartons and payments. Accounted for." lede="For distributors who need clear units and a traceable order-to-dispatch workflow." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>A carton is not a loose unit</h2>
<p>Catalogue each sellable pack explicitly. Mixed-unit conversions and breaking bulk require defined rules; the assistant should never guess a conversion.</p>
<h2>Receive stock, then sell it</h2>
<p>A supplier order is not stock on hand. Record what was actually delivered, then reserve and dispatch against available quantities.</p>
<h2>Keep credit visible</h2>
<p>Show remaining invoice balances. Complex credit limits, supplier purchasing and multiple warehouses need additional releases beyond the initial pilot.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
